resources.string:
After copying or selecting text (in any app), a floating "Translate" button will appear in the top-right corner of the screen. Tap it to translate and view the result in a pop-up window. 

 Required steps: 
 1. Grant the "Display over other apps" (floating window) permission; 
 2. Enable this app's Accessibility Service (the only way for Android 10+ to read the clipboard in the background); 
 3. Allow this app to auto-start in the system settings and disable battery optimization to prevent the service from being terminated.
